<title>POLAND: RELPOL SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 560,600.</title>
<headline>RELPOL SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 560,600.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.56 vs   0.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.94 vs   0.69</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.42 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Sales		    3.13 vs   3.63</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.10 vs   3.78</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.13 vs   4.51</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.35 vs   5.50</p>
<p> Sales		   28.77 vs  28.88</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish electromagnetic transmitter</p>
<p>maker is Relpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
